1
00:00:08,272 --> 00:00:10,022
- There. Done.
- All right.

2
00:00:10,191 --> 00:00:12,021
Twelve minutes and 17 seconds.

3
00:00:12,193 --> 00:00:13,443
Oh, pretty good, right?

4
00:00:13,611 --> 00:00:15,821
(Sheldon:)That's 4.9 Penny Blossoms per hour.

5
00:00:15,988 --> 00:00:19,118
(Sheldon:)Based on your cost of materials
and your wholesale selling price...

6
00:00:19,283 --> 00:00:24,033
(Sheldon:)...you'll effectively be paying yourself
$5. 19 a day.

7
00:00:24,663 --> 00:00:25,703
(Sheldon:)A day?

8
00:00:25,873 --> 00:00:29,663
(Sheldon:)There are children in a sneaker factory
in Indonesia who out-earn you.

9
00:00:31,128 --> 00:00:32,628
(Penny:)That just can't be right.

10
00:00:32,797 --> 00:00:35,127
- You're questioning my math?
- No, sorry.

11
00:00:35,549 --> 00:00:37,799
- Would you like me to show my work?
- God, no, no.

12
00:00:37,968 --> 00:00:40,718
(Penny:)- Just please tell me what to do about it.
- All right.

13
00:00:40,888 --> 00:00:44,308
(Sheldon:)Are you familiar with the development
that resulted from Honoré Blanc's...

14
00:00:44,475 --> 00:00:47,065
(Sheldon:)...1778 use of interchangeable parts?

15
00:00:51,565 --> 00:00:53,775
(Sheldon:)The assembly line, of course.

16
00:00:53,943 --> 00:00:57,943
Okay, if I'm not allowed to be snide,
you're not allowed to be condescending.

17
00:00:58,114 --> 00:01:02,024
(Sheldon:)That wasn't a part of our original agreement
and I do not agree to it now.

